{
  "description": "Executable definition of the profile: an implementation conforms if and only if it maps every input to its output. Collapse runs of ASCII whitespace (space, tab, LF, FF, CR — exactly Rust's char::is_ascii_whitespace) to one space after normalizing line endings, then trim Unicode White_Space from both ends. Generated by `cargo test -p ethos-verify --test normalization_vectors -- --ignored`; never edited by hand.",
